# Copy to .env.local. Every value is optional.
#
# With nothing set, the five scenario cards still return complete answers with
# verified citations, so the app is demonstrable on a fresh clone.
#
# The first match wins, in this order: local, Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- on-device
# Local inference. Nothing leaves the machine — the strongest privacy posture
# for a legal document, and it takes priority over any cloud key below.
#
# Ollama:  ollama serve && ollama pull qwen3:8b
# ADHIKAR_LOCAL_MODEL=qwen3:8b
#
# Any OpenAI-compatible server works. Defaults to Ollama's endpoint.
#   Ollama     http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1   (default)
#   LM Studio  http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1
#   llama.cpp  http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1
# ADHIKAR_LOCAL_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1
#
# Shown in the UI instead of "Ollama".
# ADHIKAR_LOCAL_LABEL=Ollama
#
# Reasoning models are asked NOT to think, by default.
#
# Why: measured on qwen3:8b via Ollama, with thinking enabled a 250-token budget
# was spent entirely in the `reasoning` field and produced ZERO content tokens —
# the answer never arrived. With reasoning_effort=none it answered in 9 seconds.
# Set this to 1 only if your model needs its reasoning phase.
# ADHIKAR_LOCAL_THINKING=1

# -------------------------------------------------------------------- cloud
# GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Override the model for whichever cloud provider was selected. Defaults:
#   gemini-2.0-flash / gpt-4o-mini / claude-opus-5
# ADHIKAR_MODEL=
